                <li><i class="fas fa-check"></i> Staff training included</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="https://wa.me/9647812573845?text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20HM-GymManagement%20Enterprise%20plan"
               target="_blank" class="pricing-btn">Get Started</a>
